---
export const prerender = true;
---

<html>
  <head>
    <title>Arduino | Umoral</title>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <style>
      * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
      
      body {
        font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
        background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.3), rgba(0,0,0,0.3)), url('/Umoral/bg-main.jpg');
        background-size: cover;
        background-position: center 50%;
        background-attachment: fixed;
        min-height: 100vh;
        padding: 5rem 2rem 3rem;
        color: #fff;
      }

      .nav {
        position: absolute;
        top: 2rem;
        left: 2rem;
        display: flex;
        gap: 1rem;
      }
      .nav a {
        color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
        border-radius: 4px;
      }
      .nav a:hover {
        color: #fff;
        border-color: #fff;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      }

      h1 {
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
        font-weight: 300;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        text-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
      }

      .content {
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);
        padding: 3rem;
        border-radius: 12px;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
        color: #2a2a2a;
      }

      .content p {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      }

      @media (max-width: 600px) {
        .content { padding: 2rem 1.5rem; }
        h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <nav class="nav">
      <a href="/Umoral/">← На главную</a>
      <a href="/Umoral/content/creativity/poems/">← К творчеству</a>
    </nav>
    
    <h1>Arduino</h1>
    
    <div class="content">
      <p>Здесь будут проекты, схемы и заметки о Arduino.</p>
      <p>Раздел в разработке...</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>